WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.000
In the Heian era, Fujiwara Sai

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.100
After a great span of time

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.500
Was reborn in the heart of Shindou Hikaru

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.600
To master the Move Of God

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:19.030
You are holding me up strong

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:23.200
I am holding you as well

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:29.030
So let us now while wandering, live together

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.710
towards the future

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:42.970
Even when I'm capricing with my friends

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.290
I feel an emptiness in my heart

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.000
Looked at with cold eyes

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:54.200
I'm blown by the winds of a dry age

00:00:55.070 --> 00:01:02.830
Feelings of doubt and courage are back to back

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:11.290
but I'll make these dreams come true now with my own hands

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:17.090
The days where I'm hurt and about to break

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:23.040
The days where I cry and trouble you, They all exist

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:27.240
but we will get over it heading

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:32.330
higher then anyone else

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:46.400
Eh, He lost

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.000
Akira-Kun lost?

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:55.500
Match #2 Discovered weakness

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.100
Good afternoon

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.400
oh, Akari-Chan

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.400
Is Hikaru-Kun here

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.900
actually... he started going to Igo school

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.300
Igo?

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.500
Really, I wonder what his up to

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.100
Hikaru-Kun plays... Igo?

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:21.300
Well..

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.000
Then, lets look at the diagram

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:24.900
In this case…

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.700
Black below is for both defense and offense

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.000
Even if white defended like this

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:33.600
You attack from here

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:36.600
And let white take both points

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:39.100
After that, if you take 'me' here

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.500
White will lose

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:47.300
I have no idea what his talking about

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:49.900
Thats because you're a beginner

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:57.100
If you go ahead and take 'me' first, then what?

00:02:58.300 --> 00:02:59.300
19-16

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:00.800
Correct

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:03.800
If you go here, white will

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.400
I wonder how good the teacher is
If you go here, white will

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.300
I wonder how good the teacher is

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:08.700
His a pro

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:10.200
Pro?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.700
That means he makes a living by playing Go

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.500
Then, the lecture ends here. Lets play with each other

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.100
Please

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.000
Let's see

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.400
You are Shindou-Kun right?

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.300
Yeah

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.000
Is this your first time

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:29.900
I've played once before

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:33.000
But at the time it was like I was an observer

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.700
Then shall we play a caputring stones game?

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.800
I know this

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:46.800
If white goes here, its gonna be taken right?

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:48.500
Right

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:53.100
When you're just one move away from caputring a stone

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.500
Its called Atari

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:56.800
Okay, what about this one?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.600
Atari. Okay, Shindou-Kun try to run

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:02.700
Lets see...

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.100
Yes, Atari

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.600
Atari

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:13.900
Atari

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.300
Atari again

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:29.600
Yes, thank you very much

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.700
This is called 'Shicho'

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.800
No matter how hard you try to run, you won't be able to get away

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.900
This happens often during a game

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.500
Can you just watch and think about that today?

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.200
This isnt good..

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.600
Hikaru, are you leaving already?

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.300
I'm just taking a break

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.600
What is this?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.000
A vending machine

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.400
If you put money in, a drink comes out

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:22.700
Ah, I'm running late again

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:24.700
Huh, Hikaru-Kun

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:27.200
You started playing Go too?

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:28.600
Yeah, sort of

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.400
I have a friend who likes to play Go

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.500
I play with him sometimes but

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.900
I can't play well because I don't know anything about Go

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:40.000
I figured I come here to learn the basics..

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.600
I still don't understand anything

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:44.300
And you're killing time here?

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:48.300
Look, this is Tengensei Live TV

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.800
Hikaru, what is this?

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:53.000
A man is playing Igo inside a box

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:56.800
His hand has stopped

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.600
Now, the things to wonder about are…

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:01.700
Let's see, what would that be?

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.600
In the case of Touya Meijin…

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.300
Even if he plays 'fuseki'

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:10.600
I feel he is always aiming for, Something greater than what is already considered good

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.600
Something that we cannot see

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.100
Yes, Yes

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:19.400
This guy is considered to be the closest person to a "Move of God"

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.800
A "Move of God"

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:24.100
I kinda, admire him

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.900
This man, isn't a mere player

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:34.100
His just like me, trying to master a "Move of God"

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:40.800
Speaking of which, Touya Meijin has a son, who also wants to be a pro

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.600
Yeah, he seems pretty strong

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.500
Ma'am, dont you have to go to class?

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:47.900
Oh Yeah

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.100
Shirakawa-sensei is nice too

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:55.200
Ah, Welcome

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.100
Is Akira-sensei here?

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:59.500
I want to play a game with him

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.700
He is here, but…

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.400
Since that game last week, he hasn't played with anyone

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:10.700
His only been laying stones out like that

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.700
Is that the game…

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:17.100
When he lost by 2 moku to the boy who was the same age as him?

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:24.000
I'm leaving

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.600
Take care

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:28.500
Oh, Akira-Kun

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:29.700
You're still here?

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:34.100
If you go home so late, your mother is going to worry…

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:37.600
What's wrong with Akira-Kun

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.200
Well…You know

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.000
Every move

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.300
Every move

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.600
It was like the moves of a Go master

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.900
If that was his true skill…

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.800
No, it can't be

00:07:57.600 --> 00:07:59.000
There can't be such a kid!

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:01.600
I don't get it…

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.900
Just what is he? that kid

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.200
Okay then, thats it for today

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.100
Don't forget to do your homework

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.100
Sensei, bye bye

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:05.900
Be careful going home

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.300
Goodbye, Sensei

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:08.600
Ah Shindou-Kun

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.000
Lately, you often seem out of it

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.500
But, your last test results were really good

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.200
Do you have a private tutor?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.800
Well somewhat..

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:23.300
But he is sort of troublesome sometimes

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.700
Keep it up and do your best

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.500
yea, later Sensei

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.200
Be carefull going home

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:29.700
Okay

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:32.900
Hikaru

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.800
Hikaru, whats been up with you latley

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.400
You do poorly in your favorite gym classes

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.400
But you did really well on the makeup test

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.500
Is it strange for me to do good on a test

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.700
Thats not what I mean, but

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.900
Hey, why don't we go play tomorrow? Its Sunday

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.300
Tomorrow

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.300
Tomorrow I need to…

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:57.300
I need to go..

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.100
To Igo school?

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.100
Huh, you knew

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:04.400
Do you wanna go too?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:06.600
Me?

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.600
Pleased to meet you

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:15.700
I'm sorry, but she really wanted to come and watch

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.500
It's alright

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:20.800
I always welcome anybody who is interested in Go

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:27.600
Most people these days often lay thier stones on the star
But 'komoku is still popular

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.400
If you protect 'ko' in 'keima'

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.700
It's as if you have already taken the corner

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:35.700
Hikaru, do you understand what he is saying

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.300
Not at all

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:39.700
But during a game

00:10:39.700 --> 00:10:43.600
Your opponent wont always allow you to play like this to your fullest

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.300
Then, if white goes here

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.100
What should black do?

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.000
Ah, I know this!

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:52.700
Shindou-Kun, right?

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:54.600
Then where would you go?

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.200
16-5

00:10:58.500 --> 00:10:59.600
16-5

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:00.800
Behind the star

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.800
16-5, here?...

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:13.300
You said it's your first time playing Go, right?

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:15.300
Did I make a mistake? I'm sorry

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:16.900
No

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.200
It's very good

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:25.100
We rarely see this style now, but a long time ago it was used often

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:29.000
Oh, you can sit down

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:29.900
Okay

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:34.700
Well, why isn't this style used now?

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:37.800
There was no rule of 'Komi' a long time ago

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:38.900
Komi?

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.100
Black has an advantage because it goes first

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:45.400
So 'White han' is given to white for that

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:50.200
In other words, if white has 50 moku at the end,

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:53.800
Black must have 56 moku in order to win

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.400
I see, 'gomoku han…

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:58.000
I see,? You didn't know?

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:02.200
In the Shuusaku era, there was no such rule

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:06.400
When you played as black didn't you think you had an advantage?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.900
I never lost when my stone was black

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:11.200
Honestly…

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.700
I see 'Komi' 'Gomoku han' is it

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.500
Since this rule was set up

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:20.200
The 'kosumi' style doesn't give as much of an advantage.

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:25.700
People started to think like that, And now this style is rarely used

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:29.500
But it is still a great move

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:35.400
If you think the number of stones in Shindou-Kun's hand is odd

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:40.400
Put one stone on the board, If you think it's even, put two.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:44.700
Now Shindou-Kun, count them.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.200
2…4…5…6…9

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:47.900
It's odd

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.200
I'm right?

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:50.500
Then You are black then

00:12:51.300 --> 00:12:54.100
When you are playing against someone who is at the same level

00:12:54.100 --> 00:12:55.800
This is the way to decide who will go first

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:00.200
It's Go played by a pro

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:03.500
Today you can lay out the stones by looking at the book

00:13:03.900 --> 00:13:05.500
Then, I'll see you later

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.600
Hey Hikaru, do you get it?

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:15.700
It looks like we should lay the stones out in order of these numbers

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.300
Look Akari, this is the first one

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:19.300
Where?

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.600
This, This

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:23.200
Yes, that's 6 stones captured

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.400
You really like to have your stones captured don't you

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:30.700
Hakoda-san is bullying a weak player again

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.300
I hate it.

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.500
You are laying your stones in such stupid places

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:42.000
It's rare for a person to want to lose

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.300
A wig?

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:44.500
I can't stand this

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.900
Hikaru, please take his opponents place

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:51.000
There's not even a single right move

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:51.600
Sai?

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:56.000
A strong person bullying a weak person in Go I cannot forgive that

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:59.800
I shall take the place of his terrified foe

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:03.200
And make him suffer a humiliation equal to his actions

00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.700
Then at the final moment I shall tell him…

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:08.900
Oops, Sorry

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:11.700
What the hell are you doing kid

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:14.700
This perfectly good game is ruined now

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.600
Ah, my hand just slipped a little

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:19.400
I'll just take my stones right now

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:19.900
What?

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:21.500
Don't

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:23.200
Ho.. Hold on

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.800
Shindou-Kun! Please go home!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.700
Geez, I came along for you!

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.500
You came along on your own

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:37.200
I don't know!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:43.000
I can't play Go now because you made the teacher mad!!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.100
That's right

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:55.300
Next week there's a tournament

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:57.300
I'll take you to the tournament…

00:14:57.300 --> 00:14:58.500
So, thats alright, right?

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:00.100
Hikaru!

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:32.100
What's with this atmosphere?

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:34.500
There are kids even younger then me

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.900
Those people are their parents and families

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.600
Sai, it's very amazing!

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:48.900
Yes, it's very amazing

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.400
There are so many children

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.800
My 1,000 year old passion for Igo

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.100
And these children's passion are the same

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.800
They are proof to me that

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:05.600
It will be the same 1,000 years from now

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:15.400
Oh yeah, there may be a chance that he's here

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:18.900
Akira-Kun

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:22.800
Hirose-san came to ask you to teach him with instructive Go

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.700
I'm sorry, but...

00:16:27.600 --> 00:16:29.400
You're still waiting for that kid?

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.800
There are way too many kids, I can't tell if he's here

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:38.200
The upper left corner of this game

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:39.800
This?

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:42.300
He'll lose if he fails to lay his stone properly

00:16:43.600 --> 00:16:45.000
1's 2nd is the weak point

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.700
Almost! Just one more above it!

00:16:51.700 --> 00:16:52.100
You!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.500
What are you thinking?

00:16:55.000 --> 00:16:57.000
Talking to them during a match

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:58.300
So-Sorry

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.900
Oh well, no need to be so loud

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:02.300
Ogata-sensei

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.300
Anyway, I'll take this kid to the office

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:06.400
Please

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:07.900
Now, come on

00:17:09.600 --> 00:17:10.500
Ah, It's okay now

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:12.600
You can continue your match

00:17:13.300 --> 00:17:15.100
So, tell me what happened

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.800
I laid my stone at 1's 3rd and then that kid

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:20.200
Said, "Almost! Just one more above it"

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:21.500
This is...

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:23.600
Oh yeah!

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:28.100
I gave that kid a flyer for the National Childrens Igo Tournament

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.000
The one held at Kiin hall today?

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:33.300
Yeah, He didn't seem interested, but..

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:34.800
He might have…

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:37.400
Akira-Kun?

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:39.500
If he comes here when I'm gone

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:40.400
Tell him to wait for me

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:45.600
He's changed hasn't he? Akira-Kun

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:49.700
Till now there was no rival for him

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.400
Really

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:02.900
You can't be forgiven if you just say you happaned to say it

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:03.800
Yes..

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.700
Well? What happaned?

00:18:05.800 --> 00:18:08.300
We called the game a tie, with no win no lose

00:18:08.300 --> 00:18:09.500
And let them replay the match

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:11.900
Can't be helped

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:14.600
Ok then, you can go home

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.900
I'm sorry for all the trouble

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.400
My My

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.100
And the game was…

00:18:30.300 --> 00:18:32.100
Hey you, Your change

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.600
It was really bad doing that

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.100
I feel sorry for those kids

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.500
Be careful

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:00.400
That man…

00:19:01.100 --> 00:19:04.700
I saw him before, he's the man closest to a "Move of God"

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.800
I heard there was a bit of trouble

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:19.300
Touya-sensei

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:22.100
Anyway, please take a look at this

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:29.400
In a game like this, even a pro like us must think for a little bit

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.100
He just glanced at it and called it out

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:34.800
I see

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:38.600
Only with a glance, a pro's life or death decesion

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:44.300
There is another child that can do this besides my son Akira

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:47.900
And you let him go without even asking his name

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:48.800
I'm sorry

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:50.500
It's alright

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:53.800
If he truly is such a good player

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.900
Sooner or later

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:59.800
Someday he will appear before us pro's

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:12.200
That's because you said those pointless things

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:15.600
Oh? You wanna fight?

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.200
If you wanna fight, I'm not going to play Go anymore

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:18.400
Shindou!
If you wanna fight, I'm not going to play Go anymore

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:18.900
Shindou!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.400
Touya?

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:33.100
I found you

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:37.600
I finally found you

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:40.000
Shindou Hikaru!

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.550
where is it
どこにあるのかな

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:49.380
The treasure that belongs to me
ボクだけの宝物

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:56.300
Now towards a great adventure
今　大きな冒険へ

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:58.940
The gentle sunlight
やわらかな日差し

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:01.330
A feeling of depature
旅立ちの予感

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:05.350
The sky and the flower are both laughing
空も花も　ホラ 笑っている

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:10.270
I wonder what waits ahead for me
この先には何が待つのだろう

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:12.460
Take A deep breath
深呼吸

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:20.700
Place your hand gently on the door to your dreams, and let's go
夢の扉にそっと手をかけて　行こう

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.800
While blown by the wind
風に吹かれながら

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:24.600
While rocking your heart
心揺らしながら

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:29.100
holding a blank map in one hand
真っ白な地図を片手に持ちながら

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:30.900
While blown by the wind
風に吹かれながら

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:33.050
While drawing in tomorrow
明日を描きながら

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:34.680
far away until I
遠くまで　何処まで

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.300
reach that place
たどり着けるまで

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:41.400
I won't lose, I wont cry
絶対負けないよ　絶対泣かないよ

00:21:41.460 --> 00:21:45.910
Until the day that i make this dream come true
この夢を叶えるその日までは

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:47.790
The sky was laughing
あの空は笑っていた

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:49.830
That flower was laughing too
あの花は笑っていた

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:53.580
Some day I will laugh with you
ボクもいつか笑うから

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:57.870
I will surpass any obstacle
どんな壁も越えるから

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:03.350
I'm not afraid of anything any more
もう　何も何も　コワクナイ
